<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MARCH 27.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MARCH 27.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Thursday, March 27 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   27.03.97	  26.03.97     </p>
<p>    USD	     4.0000	 4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	     6.4742	 6.4672</p>
<p>    DEM	     2.3704	 2.3710</p>
<p>    ECU	     4.6018	 4.6046</p>
<p>    100JPY	  3.2204	 3.2427</p>
<p>    SEK	     0.5201	 0.5228</p>
<p>    FIM	     0.7951	 0.7936</p>
<p>    EKK	     0.2965	 0.2963</p>
<p>    LAT	     6.8805	 6.8841</p>
<p>    1000RUR	 0.6986	 0.6997</p>
<p>    PLN	     1.2972	 1.2983</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
